<title>USA: G7 will note euro as source of stability--Santer.</title>
<headline>G7 will note euro as source of stability--Santer.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commission President Jacques Santer said friday that the final statement by Group of Seven leaders here would take note of the euro single currency as a factor in international monetary stability.</p>
<p>&quot;The final communique will refer to the euro as a stabilizing factor in the international monetary system,&quot; Santer told reporters.</p>
</text>
